#! An unimplemented method yields MethodNotFound, never a hang. The server
#! serves diagnostics, hover, documentSymbol, formatting, codeAction,
#! completion, (s133) definition/references/rename and (s134) signature
#! help, semantic tokens full/range, inlay hints; everything else —
#! semantic-token deltas, type definition, the pull-diagnostics model —
#! must answer -32601 and leave the session usable, which the hover
#! afterwards proves. (This script probed `definition` until s133 served
#! it, and `signatureHelp`/`semanticTokens/full` until s134 did.)
name      lifecycle/unknown-method
profile   minimal

initialize
open      hello.lu
wait      diagnostics hello.lu
req       raw textDocument/typeDefinition {"textDocument":{"uri":"file://$WS/hello.lu"},"position":{"line":8,"character":3}}
req       raw textDocument/semanticTokens/full/delta {"textDocument":{"uri":"file://$WS/hello.lu"},"previousResultId":"0"}
req       hover hello.lu 8:7
shutdown
